  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PENRA-PV Hybrid Systems for Public Heallth facililties in the West Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, led by the Palestinian Energy &amp; Natural Resources Authority (PENRA), aims to install PV hybrid systems in public health sector facilities across the West Bank. This initiative addresses the critical need for reliable energy in hospitals, especially during conflicts and instability. The project will install PV systems on the rooftops or parking lots of 13 hospitals, with a total proposed capacity of 3.24 MWp, backed by storage solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
